{"seq":1,"slug":"why-flows","title":"为何标准化流：精确似然与精确采样的稀缺组合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/normalizing-flows/foundations/why-flows","wordCount":1785,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何标准化流-精确似然与精确采样的稀缺组合\">为何标准化流：精确似然与精确采样的稀缺组合</h1><p>给你一堆人脸照片，让你造一个能生成新人脸、又能对任意一张脸打出&quot;这有多像真人脸&quot;精确分数的模型。这两个要求——采样和算密度——同时满足，比想象中难得多。GAN 会采样但给不出密度；VAE 只给密度的下界；自回归模型密度精确但采样慢如蜗牛。标准化流是少数几个把这两件事都做到&quot;精确&quot;的家族，代价是它对模型结构下了一道别人不用遵守的铁律：每一层都必须可逆。这道铁律是理解流的一切设计的起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把简单分布-流-成复杂分布\">核心概念：把简单分布&quot;流&quot;成复杂分布</h2><p>标准化流的世界观异常简洁。选一个我们完全掌握的简单分布——基分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>Z</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_Z(z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，通常是标准正态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{N}(0, I)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。再造一个可逆、可微的变换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，把数据 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 映到隐空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，它的逆 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g = f^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 则把隐变量映回数据 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x = g(z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不再需要写解析式，它由基分布&quot;经过变换诱导&quot;而来。</p>\n<p>&quot;流&quot;这个名字来自把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 拆成一列简单变换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>∘</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>∘</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f = f_K \\circ \\cdots \\circ f_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，数据像流水一样依次穿过每一层，逐步从复杂形状被&quot;标准化&quot;成规整的高斯——反过来看，采样时高斯噪声逐层被雕刻成数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  X[&quot;数据 x&lt;br/&gt;复杂分布 p_X&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;f₁&quot;| H1[&quot;中间表示&quot;]&#10;  H1 --&gt;|&quot;f₂ ... f_K&quot;| Z[&quot;隐变量 z&lt;br/&gt;基分布 N(0,I)&quot;]&#10;  Z --&gt;|&quot;g = f⁻¹&quot;| X2[&quot;采样出的新数据&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n  X[\"数据 x&lt;br/&gt;复杂分布 p_X\"] --&gt;|\"f₁\"| H1[\"中间表示\"]\n  H1 --&gt;|\"f₂ ... f_K\"| Z[\"隐变量 z&lt;br/&gt;基分布 N(0,I)\"]\n  Z --&gt;|\"g = f⁻¹\"| X2[\"采样出的新数据\"]</pre><p>关键在于：因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 可逆且雅可比行列式可算，数据密度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_X(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 能被<strong>精确</strong>写出（这正是<a href=\"change-of-variables\">变量替换公式</a>的内容）。既能算密度又能采样，且两者都精确——这就是流的全部价值主张。</p>\n<p>下表把主流生成模型放在同一张桌子上对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>家族</th>\n<th>精确似然</th>\n<th>快速采样</th>\n<th>可逆/隐变量</th>\n<th>训练目标</th>\n<th>典型代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准化流</td>\n<td>是（精确）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是（同一网络双向）</td>\n<td>极大似然</td>\n<td>结构受限、参数效率低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VAE</td>\n<td>否（ELBO 下界）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>近似（编码器/解码器分离）</td>\n<td>变分下界</td>\n<td>密度只有下界、样本偏糊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GAN</td>\n<td>否（无密度）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>对抗博弈</td>\n<td>无似然、训练不稳、模式坍缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自回归模型</td>\n<td>是（精确）</td>\n<td>否（逐元素）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>极大似然</td>\n<td>采样 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 串行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩散模型</td>\n<td>否（变分下界/近似）</td>\n<td>否（多步迭代）</td>\n<td>部分（连续时间可逆）</td>\n<td>去噪分数匹配</td>\n<td>采样慢、似然非精确</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"可逆性这道铁律带来了什么\">可逆性这道铁律带来了什么</h2><p>流要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 处处可逆，这不是可选项而是定义。它的直接后果是一连串强约束：输入与输出维度必须相等（不能像 VAE 那样压缩到低维瓶颈）；每一层的变换必须双射；雅可比行列式必须非零且可算。这些约束是流&quot;又能采样又能算密度&quot;的来源，也是它最大的工程负担。</p>\n<p>维度守恒尤其反直觉。数据往往躺在高维空间里的一张低维流形上（人脸的自由度远小于像素数），而流被迫在全维空间里建模，等于要为流形之外那片&quot;空气&quot;也分配概率密度。这带来所谓的流形错配问题：流会把密度&quot;漏&quot;到数据流形附近的薄壳里。实践中靠去量化和多尺度结构缓解，但它是流相比 VAE/扩散的一处结构性短板。</p>\n<p>可逆性也约束了单层的表达力。一个仿射变换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⊙</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = a \\odot x + b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊙</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 显然可逆，但它太弱，只能做线性拉伸。流的全部架构艺术，就是在&quot;保持可逆且雅可比可算&quot;的前提下，尽可能提升单层表达力，再靠堆叠多层把弱变换组合成强变换。这条主线贯穿<a href=\"../architectures/coupling-flows\">耦合流</a>、<a href=\"../architectures/autoregressive-flows\">自回归流</a>与 Glow。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么精确似然值得这么大代价\">为什么精确似然值得这么大代价</h2><p>既然约束这么多，为什么还要用流？因为精确似然本身是稀缺资源，在几类任务上无可替代。</p>\n<p>其一是密度估计与异常检测：给定一个样本，直接算出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_X(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，密度低即异常。VAE 只有下界、GAN 根本没有密度，都做不到这件事的严谨版本。其二是似然比与假设检验：物理、天文、金融里大量任务需要精确的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x|\\theta_1)/p(x|\\theta_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，流是天然工具，这催生了基于模拟的推断（simulation-based inference）这一整个方向。其三是变分推断：把流当作灵活的后验分布族 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_\\phi(z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，因为能精确算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，ELBO 里的熵项就能精确评估——这是流在贝叶斯计算里的主场，详见<a href=\"../practice/flow-applications\">应用</a>。</p>\n<p>换句话说，当你的任务真正需要&quot;这个样本出现的概率是多少&quot;这个精确数字时，流几乎是唯一选项。当你只需要&quot;给我一张好看的图&quot;时，2026 年扩散模型往往更香。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年流还站得住吗\">2026 年流还站得住吗</h2><p>坦白说，纯图像生成的赛道，扩散模型和 flow matching 已经全面领先经典逐层流。但故事有个反转：2024 年以来兴起的 flow matching 与随机插值方法，训练的正是连续标准化流（CNF），只是把训练目标从极大似然换成了对速度场的回归，从而绕开了逐层求逆的枷锁。据 2025–2026 年的多篇综述（如 npj Artificial Intelligence 的 flow matching 生物学综述），这类回归式训练的连续流在表达力、可扩展性和训练难度上已经反超经典的极大似然流。也就是说，&quot;流&quot;这个框架非但没过时，反而借连续化获得了新生——细节见<a href=\"../jacobian/continuous-flows\">连续流</a>。</p>\n<p>与此同时，经典逐层流在需要精确似然的科学计算领域（粒子物理的格点采样、分子构象生成、天体物理的 SBI）依然是主力，因为那里&quot;精确密度&quot;不是加分项而是硬需求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>标准化流用一列可逆可微变换，把简单基分布雕刻成复杂数据分布，从而同时获得精确采样与精确密度。</li>\n<li>与 VAE（下界）、GAN（无密度）、自回归（采样慢）、扩散（似然近似）相比，流独占&quot;两者皆精确&quot;的生态位，代价是可逆性铁律。</li>\n<li>可逆性强制维度守恒并限制单层表达力，带来流形错配等结构性短板，也逼出了流全部的架构巧思。</li>\n<li>流的护城河是精确似然：密度估计、似然比推断、变分后验是它不可替代的主场。</li>\n<li>2026 年，经典逐层流在纯图像生成上被扩散反超，但 flow matching 让连续流以回归目标重获竞争力，&quot;流&quot;框架仍在演进。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>精确密度到底怎么写出来：<a href=\"change-of-variables\">变量替换公式</a></li>\n<li>弱变换如何组合成强模型：<a href=\"flow-model\">流模型框架</a>、<a href=\"../architectures/coupling-flows\">耦合流</a></li>\n<li>连续化如何让流重获新生：<a href=\"../jacobian/continuous-flows\">连续流</a></li>\n<li>跨库：与扩散模型的采样视角对照，见<a href=\"../../../ai-llm/diffusion-sampling-solvers/foundations/sde-ode-view\">扩散的 SDE/ODE 视角</a>；密度建模的另一条路，见<a href=\"../../kernel-density-estimation/foundations/why-kde\">核密度估计</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何标准化流：精确似然与精确采样的稀缺组合","id":"为何标准化流-精确似然与精确采样的稀缺组合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把简单分布\"流\"成复杂分布","id":"核心概念-把简单分布-流-成复杂分布"},{"level":2,"text":"可逆性这道铁律带来了什么","id":"可逆性这道铁律带来了什么"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么精确似然值得这么大代价","id":"为什么精确似然值得这么大代价"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年流还站得住吗","id":"2026-年流还站得住吗"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"变量替换公式：密度如何在可逆变换间守恒","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/normalizing-flows/foundations/change-of-variables"}}